  "description": "A self-contained TOML (v1.0.0 / v1.1.0) library for .NET 8, shaped after System.Text.Json and matching the sibling Bodu.Text.Bencode surface: the TomlSerializer POCO mapper (converters, the full attribute family, naming policies, callbacks), the forward-only ref-struct Utf8TomlReader/Utf8TomlWriter token surface, a mutable TomlNode DOM, and a read-only TomlDocument DOM. Adds native float, boolean, and the four RFC 3339 date-time kinds.",
